				<pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 01:05:56 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Hello. I am the notorious PotKettleBlackHat hacker.&#xA;This blog is a collection of my ramblings from daily life.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I make sure to not post too much information here, I know im a literal opsec master, but even Gods can bleed.&#xA;Anyways hope you enjoy the blog!!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;PotKettleBlackHat&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
