			<item>
				<title>New Keyboard</title>
				<link>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/new-kb/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 20:03:26 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/new-kb/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Finally replaced my keyboard today.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The old one was getting ridiculous. Half the keys needed to be hit twice and the space bar had developed this horrible squeak that made it sound like I was typing inside an old cupboard.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The new one is much quieter, which is nice because I tend to use my computer late at night.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Spent most of the afternoon setting everything up and moving things around on my desk. I also found a pile of receipts underneath my monitor that I have apparently been ignoring for several months.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>The Guy Who Kept Arguing</title>
				<link>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/arguement/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 22:18:43 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/arguement/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Some people genuinely don&amp;rsquo;t know when to stop talking.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I was in a group chat tonight and one guy kept arguing with everyone about absolutely everything. Nothing serious. Just one of those people who has to correct every sentence somebody writes.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Eventually he started having a go at me specifically.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I told him to leave it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He didn&amp;rsquo;t.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Then he started with the usual stuff about how nobody could possibly know who he was because he didn&amp;rsquo;t use his real name.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Rainy Sunday</title>
				<link>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/rainy_sunday/</link>
				<pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 18:42:11 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/rainy_sunday/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;It has rained pretty much all day.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I had planned to go out this morning but when I opened the curtains it looked like the entire street had been abandoned, so I went back to bed instead. Woke up again around eleven and spent another twenty minutes convincing myself that getting up was worth it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Eventually I did.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Made some toast, cleaned the kitchen and then went into town to get a few things. I only needed shampoo and toothpaste but somehow came home with a new hoodie and a takeaway. This happens every time I go shopping.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Hello World</title>
				<link>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/helloworld/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 01:07:07 +0100</pubDate>
				<guid>https://p0tkettlebl4ckh4t.github.io/posts/helloworld/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Hello! Welcome to my blog.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve been meaning to make one of these for ages but never really got around to it. Most of the stuff I do online ends up being random posts or messages that disappear after a few days, so I thought it would be nice to actually keep track of things somewhere.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ll probably write about whatever I&amp;rsquo;m doing, which could be anything from computers and random projects to films I&amp;rsquo;ve watched or places I&amp;rsquo;ve been.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
